ine für den Sound zuständige Freundin Lorraine  sowie Schauspieler Jackson Hole  und die Stripperinnen Maxine  und Bobby-Lynne ihren Gastgeber  jedoch nichts erzählt. Dabei handelt es sich um ein isoliertes, älteres Ehepaar, das besonders großen Wert darauf legt, dass es ihren Gästen gut geht. Als jedoch die Nacht hereinbricht, wird das schon leicht aufdringliche Verhalten des Paares plötzlich zusehends gewalttätig.","poster":"/yuiSG2HDc6wrx4AikbwrC4MQC7l.jpg","runtime":105.0,"title":"X","type":"movie","va":6.7,"vc":4244,"year":"2022"},"movie:774404":{"cast":[{"id":2592283,"name":"Ashley Hays Wright","photo":""},{"id":2592285,"name":"David Owen Wright","photo":""}],"genres":["Horror","Komödie"],"id":774404,"original":"Christmas Zombies","overview":"","poster":"/jDMQ08DqLevrjYtAT3XhBk0gP3w.jpg","runtime":66.0,"title":"Christmas Zombies","type":"movie","va":1.2,"vc":2,"year":"2020"},"movie:790846":{"cast":[{"id":2972744,"name":"Jan Oliver Lucks","photo":""},{"id":2158337,"name":"Natalie Medlock","photo":"/4q1yNtHgwpMMWxNJ9aKFGpFlHxW.jpg"}],"genres":["Dokumentarfilm"],"id":790846,"original":"There Is No \"I\" in Threesome","overview":"","poster":"/fbIXm4TetVYsqLqcLkqPr1BYaXb.jpg","runtime":87.0,"title":"There Is No \"I\" in Threesome","type":"movie","va":5.4,"vc":18,"year":"2021"},"movie:883502":{"cast":[{"id":62747,"name":"Chad Michael Murray","photo":"/jIkzUQUVLkgn3HFMFRJBDAD0OLj.jpg"},{"id":62,"name":"Bruce Willis","photo":"/w3aXr1e7gQCn8MSp1vW4sXHn99P.jpg"},{"id":57171,"name":"Jesse Metcalfe","photo":"/qZR4VAB2t0qawkH88Wv3K7y67nM.jpg"},{"id":1278867,"name":"Kelly Greyson","photo":"/dbygGZLqAqhPLQKVa24TACboAj9.jpg"},{"id":1160181,"name":"Ser'Darius Blain","photo":"/4INvD4RYdjGCznboNgdyfWA6dpG.jpg"},{"id":929065,"name":"Michael Sirow","photo":"/nhUJDr8d3RHQdz7aIVW5Jc2t3RD.jpg"},{"id":93620,"name":"Welker White","photo":"/iBHVPZZkVUIZcRDV6NaGuAL2OeI.jpg"},{"id":2070149,"name":"Natali Yura","photo":"/hu0yDZwdHZyv24BAyJzrfq2hjPr.jpg"}],"genres":["Action","Thriller","Krimi"],"id":883502,"original":"Fortress: Sniper's Eye","overview":"Ex-CIA-Agent Robert Michaels löst ein Versprechen ein, das er seinem Erzfeind, dem Schwerverbrecher Frederick Balzary, gegeben hatte: Mit Hilfe seines von ihm entfremdeten Sohns Paul befreit er Balzarys verschleppte Ehefrau Sasha aus der Gewalt von Terroristen. Im Anschluss kehren alle in die Hochsicherheits-Wohnanlage für pensionierte Geheimagenten zurück, wo Robert versucht, seinen Ruhestand zu genießen. Doch Sasha scheint plötzlich längst nicht mehr so hilflos zu sein, wie gedacht. Denn überraschenderweise sieht sich das Vater-Sohn-Gespann dank ihr mit einem alten Widersacher konfrontiert, von dem es nicht erwartet hätte, ihm jemals wieder gegenübertreten zu müssen …","poster":"/hrcbLDbM6YP8aeALvcrg8SQepie.jpg","runtime":93.0,"title":"Fortress 2: Sniper's Eye","type":"movie","va":5.2,"vc":180,"year":"2022"},"movie:890533":{"cast":[{"id":1282986,"name":"Raj Tarun","photo":"/mSPPLTJfzmGRrmTG23IZ4VhWVcp.jpg"},{"id":3286347,"name":"Kashish Khan","photo":"/oLsjfD6aEzNFlwkFiLpPeISwvBd.jpg"},{"id":586625,"name":"Ajay","photo":"/uByCHJa3eaCL0SgFGDYYLlsVggC.jpg"},{"id":1163230,"name":"Posani Krishna Murali","photo":"/mJHo1EvOORv2FAK12zpFESDQfM.jpg"},{"id":101860,"name":"Aadarsh Balakrishna","photo":"/rOmqQfm3ArplVU37PXhlOeUo7aW.jpg"},{"id":1543712,"name":"Nellore Sudharshan","photo":"/8kpem5ZHfy90DYyYE9QamqrE6eb.jpg"},{"id":503842,"name":"Adukalam Naren","photo":"/w3a6Qwh6pbnU2j7vJlzpyc2r7Dw.jpg"},{"id":1838566,"name":"Temper Vamsi","photo":"/7QmDysL95O4LFocakRIZeE2Np9Q.jpg"}],"genres":["Liebesfilm","Komödie"],"id":890533,"original":"అనుభవించు రాజా","overview":"","poster":"/5V02MT4I0b2n0MuPlhl770DGbPJ.jpg","runtime":131.0,"title":"అనుభవించు రాజా","type":"movie","va":3.7,"vc":3,"year":"2021"},"movie:892153":{"cast":[{"id":2727292,"name":"George Ackles","photo":"/bpLUyoMx0IYiMOf51SZg1JkCBvK.jpg"},{"id":1984038,"name":"Sean Burgos","photo":"/l7WqU6nLrlRabVVwjooV7a2CwIs.jpg"},{"id":82816,"name":"Trevor Devall","